{"sha": "fc62430481d26eb90fd10791eaba1bf1ed8637d22120f559f08dfb57e9a10ce1", "body": ["\\begin{definition}[齐齐巴宾反应]\\label{def:b3:heterocycles:chichibabin}", "The \\emph{齐齐巴宾反应}\\index{齐齐巴宾反应}是用氨基钠对吡啶的", "C2 位进行的氨基化：酰胺负离子加成到 C2 上，并失去一个", "氢负离子，该氢负离子与产物反应后以氢气的形式放出。", "\\end{definition}", "", "吡啶和 DMAP 也用作碱和亲核催化剂：在", "与酸酐的酰化反应中，DMAP 先进攻酸酐，生成一个", "酰基吡啶鎓离子，它把酰基转移到醇上的速度远快于", "酸酐本身。吡啶、联吡啶和菲啰啉是配位化学中最常见的", "配体之一。", "", "\\section{五元环}", "", "\\begin{proposition}[吡咯在 C2 位的亲电取代]\\label{prop:b3:heterocycles:pyrrole-c2}", "吡咯、呋喃和噻吩主要在 C2 位发生亲电取代，", "原因在于进攻 C2 位所生成的阳离子有三种共振结构，", "而进攻 C3 位的只有两种。", "\\end{proposition}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "进攻 C2 位后，正电荷可位于 C3、C5 或氮原子上，", "此时正电荷通过氮的孤电子对离域，且每个原子都保持八隅体（第三种", "结构）。进攻 C3 位后，正电荷只能位于 C2 或氮上，电荷", "的离域程度较低（见图）。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[font=\\small]", "  \\draw[thick] (0.000,0.620) -- (0.590,0.192) -- (0.364,-0.502) -- (-0.364,-0.502) -- (-0.590,0.192) -- cycle;", "  \\draw[thick] (-0.303,-0.269) -- (-0.403,0.039);", "  \\node[fill=white, inner sep=0.4pt, font=\\scriptsize] at (0.000,0.620) {N};", "  \\draw (0.000,0.750) -- (0.000,1.020) node[above, inner sep=0.5pt, font=\\scriptsize] {H};", "  \\draw (0.590,0.192) -- (0.893,0.482) node[right, inner sep=0.5pt, font=\\scriptsize] {H};", "  \\draw (0.590,0.192) -- (1.006,0.135) node[right, inner sep=0.5pt, font=\\scriptsize] {E};", "  \\node[font=\\scriptsize, omThm] at (0.164,-0.226) {$\\oplus$};", "  \\draw[thick] (2.600,0.620) -- (3.190,0.192) -- (2.964,-0.502) -- (2.236,-0.502) -- (2.010,0.192) -- cycle;", "  \\draw[thick] (2.762,-0.371) -- (2.438,-0.371);", "  \\node[fill=white, inner sep=0.4pt, font=\\scriptsize] at (2.600,0.620) {N};", "  \\draw (2.600,0.750) -- (2.600,1.020) node[above, inner sep=0.5pt, font=\\scriptsize] {H};", "  \\draw (3.190,0.192) -- (3.493,0.482) node[right, inner sep=0.5pt, font=\\scriptsize] {H};", "  \\draw (3.190,0.192) -- (3.606,0.135) node[right, inner sep=0.5pt, font=\\scriptsize] {E};", "  \\node[font=\\scriptsize, omThm] at (2.335,0.086) {$\\oplus$};", "  \\draw[thick] (5.200,0.620) -- (5.790,0.192) -- (5.564,-0.502) -- (4.836,-0.502) -- (4.610,0.192) -- cycle;", "  \\draw[thick] (5.362,-0.371) -- (5.038,-0.371);", "  \\draw[thick] (5.113,0.395) -- (4.851,0.205);", "  \\node[fill=white, inner sep=0.4pt, font=\\scriptsize] at (5.200,0.620) {N};", "  \\draw (5.200,0.750) -- (5.200,1.020) node[above, inner sep=0.5pt, font=\\scriptsize] {H};", "  \\draw (5.790,0.192) -- (6.093,0.482) node[right, inner sep=0.5pt, font=\\scriptsize] {H};", "  \\draw (5.790,0.192) -- (6.206,0.135) node[right, inner sep=0.5pt, font=\\scriptsize] {E};", "  \\node[font=\\scriptsize, omThm] at (5.480,0.700) {$\\oplus$};", "  \\draw[thick] (8.400,0.620) -- (8.990,0.192) -- (8.764,-0.502) -- (8.036,-0.502) -- (7.810,0.192) -- cycle;", "  \\draw[thick] (8.097,-0.269) -- (7.997,0.039);", "  \\node[fill=white, inner sep=0.4pt, font=\\scriptsize] at (8.400,0.620) {N};", "  \\draw (8.400,0.750) -- (8.400,1.020) node[above, inner sep=0.5pt, font=\\scriptsize] {H};", "  \\draw (8.764,-0.502) -- (9.135,-0.700) node[right, inner sep=0.5pt, font=\\scriptsize] {H};", "  \\draw (8.764,-0.502) -- (8.839,-0.915) node[right, inner sep=0.5pt, font=\\scriptsize] {E};", "  \\node[font=\\scriptsize, omThm] at (8.665,0.086) {$\\oplus$};", "  \\draw[thick] (11.000,0.620) -- (11.590,0.192) -- (11.364,-0.502) -- (10.636,-0.502) -- (10.410,0.192) -- cycle;", "  \\draw[thick] (10.697,-0.269) -- (10.597,0.039);", "  \\draw[thick] (11.087,0.395) -- (11.349,0.205);", "  \\node[fill=white, inner sep=0.4pt, font=\\scriptsize] at (11.000,0.620) {N};", "  \\draw (11.000,0.750) -- (11.000,1.020) node[above, inner sep=0.5pt, font=\\scriptsize] {H};", "  \\draw (11.364,-0.502) -- (11.735,-0.700) node[right, inner sep=0.5pt, font=\\scriptsize] {H};", "  \\draw (11.364,-0.502) -- (11.439,-0.915) node[right, inner sep=0.5pt, font=\\scriptsize] {E};", "  \\node[font=\\scriptsize, omThm] at (11.280,0.700) {$\\oplus$};", "  \\node[font=\\scriptsize] at (2.6,-1.35) {进攻 C2 位：三种结构};", "  \\node[font=\\scriptsize] at (9.7,-1.35) {进攻 C3 位：两种结构};", "  \\draw[black!40] (6.8,-1.2) -- (6.8,1.2);", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 吡咯的惠兰德中间体（E：亲电试剂；$\\oplus$：正电荷）。", "进攻 C2 位生成的阳离子，其电荷位于 C3、C5 或氮上，且所有", "八隅体均完整；进攻 C3 位时，电荷只能位于 C2 或氮上。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "吡咯的反应活性与苯酚或苯胺相当：在温和条件下即可溴代、硝化", "和酰化，在强酸中会聚合，并且", "在 C2 位被由二甲基甲酰胺和三氯氧磷", "制得的维尔斯迈尔试剂甲酰化。反应活性顺序为吡咯 $>$ 呋喃 $>$ 噻吩 $>$ 苯，", "取决于杂原子提供孤电子对参与共享的能力。呋喃", "芳香性最弱，在第尔斯–阿尔德反应中也可作双烯体参与反应。强", "碱如丁基锂，可使呋喃和噻吩在紧邻", "杂原子的 C2 位脱质子，生成有机锂试剂。", "", "\\begin{method}[预测杂环上的进攻位点]\\label{met:b3:heterocycles:site}", "\\begin{enumerate}", "  \\item 对杂环进行分类：多 $\\pi$ 杂环（类吡咯型杂原子）或", "        缺 $\\pi$ 杂环（类吡啶型氮）。", "  \\item 亲电试剂：作用于多 $\\pi$ 杂环的 C2 位（吲哚取 C3 位，因其", "        C2 位进攻会破坏苯环）；吡啶则在 C3 位，或经由", "        吡啶 N-氧化物在 C4 位反应。", "  \\item 亲核试剂：作用于缺 $\\pi$ 杂环的 C2 或 C4 位，尤其是该位置带有", "        离去基团时。", "  \\item 强碱：作用于紧邻杂原子的 C--H。", "\\end{enumerate}", "\\end{method}", "", "\\section{稠杂环与生物杂环}", "", "吲哚是苯与吡咯稠合而成的化合物，与亲电试剂在 C3 位反应：此时", "中间体保持苯环完整，电荷位于氮上。", "喹啉是苯与吡啶稠合而成，其苯环上发生亲电取代，", "亲核取代则发生在 C2 和 C4 位。碱基为", "嘧啶（胞嘧啶、胸腺嘧啶、尿嘧啶）和嘌呤（腺嘌呤、鸟嘌呤），", "嘌呤是嘧啶与咪唑稠合而成。它们的氧代形式和氨基形式（内酰胺和胺类", "互变异构体）比羟基形式和亚胺形式更占优势，", "从而决定了每个碱基上氢键给体与受体的分布，进而决定碱基配对。", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[font=\\small]", "  \\node[draw, rounded corners, minimum width=1.8cm, minimum height=2.8cm, fill=omDef!8] at (0,0) {};", "  \\node[font=\\small\\bfseries] at (0,1.75) {鸟嘌呤};", "  \\node[anchor=east] (g1) at (0.85,0.85) {C6=O};", "  \\node[anchor=east] (g2) at (0.85,0) {N1--H};", "  \\node[anchor=east] (g3) at (0.85,-0.85) {C2--N--H};", "  \\node[draw, rounded corners, minimum width=1.8cm, minimum height=2.8cm, fill=omThm!8] at (3.2,0) {};", "  \\node[font=\\small\\bfseries] at (3.2,1.75) {胞嘧啶};", "  \\node[anchor=west] (c1) at (2.35,0.85) {H--N--C4};", "  \\node[anchor=west] (c2) at (2.35,0) {N3};", "  \\node[anchor=west] (c3) at (2.35,-0.85) {O=C2};", "  \\draw[omMeth, very thick, dotted] (g1.east) -- (c1.west);", "  \\draw[omMeth, very thick, dotted] (g2.east) -- (c2.west);", "  \\draw[omMeth, very thick, dotted] (g3.east) -- (c3.west);", "\\end{tikzpicture}", ""]}